{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_164_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_164","textTraditional":"一、十有五年。春，宋公使向戌來聘。二月己亥，及向戌盟于劉。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_164_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_164","textTraditional":"二、劉夏逆王后于齊。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_164_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_164","textTraditional":"劉夏者何？天子之大夫也。劉者何？邑也。其稱劉何？以邑氏也。外逆女不書，此何以書？過我也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_164_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_164","textTraditional":"三、夏，齊侯伐我北鄙，圍成。公救成，至遇。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_164_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_164","textTraditional":"其言至遇何？不敢進也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_164_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_164","textTraditional":"四、季孫宿、叔孫豹帥師城成郛。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_164_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_164","textTraditional":"五、秋八月丁巳，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_164_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_164","textTraditional":"六、邾婁人伐我南鄙。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_164_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_164","textTraditional":"七、冬十有一月癸亥，晉侯周卒。","sentenceOrder":9}],"overrides":{}}